ered an outpouring of support  from other female democrats i was also  told in judiciary committee to learn how  to read  by another one of my members across the  aisle  these are the things that happen to us  all the time  i can tell you that firsthand they've  called me names for at least  at least 20 years of leadership 18 years  of leadership  top republican leaders say they believe  that yoho's apology was sufficient many  democrats feel otherwise  they don't even think he really  apologized at all and in a sign of how  extraordinary this moment was the  congressional tv network  c-span says that its clip of the  congresswoman speech  was the most retweeted clip ever with at  this point  more than 10 million views gail  wow oh that's impressive listen let me  tell you something yet i think women  democrats and republicans everywhere are  applauding uh  alexandria ocasio-cortez and several  good men are also giving her a round of  applause  have you ever seen anything like this  yeah yeah  i was thinking you're going to say that  have you ever seen anything like this in  congress no but we did ask the house  historians and they said yes in the past  there have been some examples of people  using four-letter words  uh just not in the tv age and so it  clearly was a standout moment just for  that reason if anything  yeah it's more than the four letter  words i think we could all take some of  her  decency class lessons very well done  thank you very much
 

